msgstr ""

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "An accessibility-first WordPress theme for content sites and WooCommerce stores. Klaro ships WCAG AAA color contrast, keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and a visitor toolbar with text sizing, high contrast, dark and monochrome modes, color vision filters, a dyslexia-friendly font, and reading aids. Its WooCommerce integration covers the shop, product pages, cart, and checkout, so customers with disabilities can browse and buy independently. The free Klaro Admin Accessibility plugin (wordpress.org/plugins/klaro-admin-accessibility/) brings the same accessibility to the WordPress admin."
msgstr ""

